{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit.recovers_classical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit.recovers_classical","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QGeometricLanglands/q_gl_classical_limit.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The remaining two legs hold jointly (with the Hecke leg above),\nrecovering $\\mathbb{L}_{\\mathrm{BD}}$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit.dual_group_limit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit.dual_group_limit","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QGeometricLanglands/q_gl_classical_limit.lean#L56-L56","doc":"**Conjecture, dual-group leg**: $\\check G_q \\to \\check G$ as the\nquantum deformation is removed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit.differential_limit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit.differential_limit","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QGeometricLanglands/q_gl_classical_limit.lean#L53-L53","doc":"**Conjecture, differential leg**: $d_q^2 \\to 0$ as $q \\to 1$, so\n$q$-flat connections become flat connections. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit.hecke_limit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit.hecke_limit","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QGeometricLanglands/q_gl_classical_limit.lean#L50-L50","doc":"**Conjecture, Hecke leg**: at $q = 1$ the $q$-Hecke relation\n$(T - q)(T + q^{-1}) = 0$ degenerates to $(T - 1)(T + 1) = 0$, so\nevery limiting eigenvalue is $\\pm 1$ (the symmetric-group action). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit.heckeEigenvalue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit.heckeEigenvalue","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QGeometricLanglands/q_gl_classical_limit.lean#L46-L46","doc":"`heckeEigenvalue q T` — `T` is a $q$-Hecke eigenvalue at parameter\n`q`, i.e. a root of $(T - q)(T + q^{-1}) = 0$.  Carried abstractly:\nthe defining relation needs `q` invertible, which a generic `Ring`\ndoes not supply, so the predicate is a class field rather than a\ndefinition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit.mk","kind":"ctor","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QGeometricLanglands/q_gl_classical_limit.lean#L40-L40","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QGeometricLanglands.q_gl_classical_limit","kind":"class","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QGeometricLanglands/q_gl_classical_limit.lean#L36-L59","doc":"**Classical limit $q \\to 1$ of the $q$-Langlands correspondence.**\n\nConjectural class — see\n[`conj:q-gl-classical-limit`](../../../quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/q-gl-classical-limit.md). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:q-gl-classical-limit","label":"conj:q-gl-classical-limit","md":"quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/q-gl-classical-limit.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}